Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.75,0:00:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.71,0:00:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.42,0:00:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重返人间的亡魂集团七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:14.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击了我们藏身的小庙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千钧一发之际
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶来相救的犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又碰上了新的对手了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.97,0:00:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.20,0:00:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.47,0:00:32.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:36.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:40.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:44.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:48.89,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:57.43,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.47,0:01:02.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:06.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:10.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:14.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:18.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:22.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.09,0:01:26.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.16,0:01:33.36,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:38.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.11,0:01:45.88,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:05.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快趴下 七宝 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.43,0:02:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 刚刚放走了你那些伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下应该没有后顾之忧了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.94,0:02:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于醒了是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:40.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就安心的在这休养吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.61,0:02:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.65,0:02:49.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来这个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.38,0:02:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他也是七人帮的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.99,0:03:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这样看来也无法使出风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.77,0:03:11.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来只好孤注一掷了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我乖乖受死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:18.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:21.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.13,0:03:41.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:48.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.11,0:03:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第106话 戈薇 弥勒 珊瑚命在旦夕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这味道是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.23,0:04:12.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是尸体跟坟土的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:15.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道前面还有七人帮吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:18.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会 应该不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股味道难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.47,0:04:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫非你…就是犬夜叉少爷吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恭候大驾很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:56.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.13,0:05:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于追到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:21.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:23.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你所见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是这座庙的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些村民一直都传言得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说十几年前丧命的那些七人帮亡魂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道为什么死后复活了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.65,0:05:38.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四处危害这里的村民
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.59,0:05:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才我埋葬的那些人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该就是被亡魂烧死的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道只有你一个人活了下来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时的情况实在太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吓得一直躲在菩萨后面不敢动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.80,0:05:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照这情形看来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你也被那些七人帮追捕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:04.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 我可要说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是被他们追捕 而是我正在追捕他们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.25,0:06:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你知道的话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得可不可以告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个七人帮 为什么突然复活了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道又能怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身为菩萨的弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.69,0:06:24.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着那么多人枉死却无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做点事弥补
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.93,0:06:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话 我打算帮那些亡魂超渡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股味道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:38.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你屈屈一个和尚就能解决的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:45.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这和尚不像是七人帮的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他身上还有活人的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:54.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.86,0:06:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞低一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:03.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.97,0:07:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是犬夜叉少爷的风之伤留下的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷大老远跑到北方来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果真不会是为了享受温泉这么简单才对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.75,0:07:21.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞高一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.82,0:07:23.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快飞高一点呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:33.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.90,0:07:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快走就会完蛋的 鸟鸦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我们 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.64,0:07:45.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一说到要去找戈薇大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙少主就跑得比飞还要快呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉那股臭味往哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.79,0:07:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…坟土的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说一个叫奈落的让亡魂死而复活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个奈落到底是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个像妖怪的家伙啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:16.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他并不是完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:18.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他早已经逃之夭夭不知道躲在哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜他一定是透过变身的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.68,0:08:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不断在累积自己的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些七人帮恐怕只是被他利用的傀儡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:49.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是银骨发动的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙难道还没死
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和尚 要命的话最好进去躲一躲
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:10.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼看就要接近真相了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算让我知道奈落这家伙根本就信不过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.08,0:09:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个家伙也可以死了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.45,0:09:33.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.15,0:09:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没打够是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.47,0:09:55.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又用钢索
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.61,0:09:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住你了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.48,0:10:00.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凭这点玩意儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道就妄想…困得住我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死家伙去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.63,0:10:20.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有一股烟味
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.50,0:10:23.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是七人帮的炼骨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚刚那个和尚… 这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.35,0:10:41.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会有人的味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛一脸不可置信的表情
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.42,0:10:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是一向号称鼻子最灵的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么刚刚又会看走眼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我身上一点都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.53,0:10:59.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七人帮的尸体跟坟土的味道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:01.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:03.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来这个地方是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座庙果然抢得很有价值
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.31,0:11:12.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整座庙四周都是坟墓
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身上的味道当然被盖过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.39,0:11:17.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.55,0:11:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又穿上那个活人和尚的袈裟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怪就怪你的鼻子实在太灵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闻到这些味道 马上就放了一百个心
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:27.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整座庙的和尚都已经被你给…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.97,0:11:32.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才你不是也看见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.70,0:11:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把他们给安葬了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.57,0:11:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才要是能够看穿你这点把戏就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那股烟是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:08.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.11,0:12:09.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.01,0:12:11.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不快起来 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我冥加爷爷呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.52,0:12:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.82,0:12:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚闻着师父香炉里的香
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.82,0:12:28.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.13,0:12:33.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.66,0:12:37.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.37,0:12:37.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都起不来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是之前中的毒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.64,0:12:51.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一个也别想逃过我雾骨大爷的毒烟
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.15,0:12:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上带着四魂之玉碎片的小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.30,0:13:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.87,0:13:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明给他们吃过解药了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.53,0:13:11.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道一点用都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.17,0:13:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 我看先把火灭了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:17.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么办法 有没有什么办法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:22.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用震荡陀螺刮起的大风吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐妖术 震荡陀螺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会反效果呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:40.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然敢放火烧庙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把火可以送他们上西天
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他们已经中毒那么深了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.75,0:13:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可以放你进去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个混帐…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.93,0:14:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚一直有股尸体跟坟土的味道传过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是妖狼族的钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.58,0:14:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有奇怪的家伙出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.15,0:14:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是凶骨那个笨怪物的同伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.39,0:14:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们身上的臭味都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来帮凶骨报仇的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:48.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身上穿的那条短短的裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.26,0:14:49.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉还真可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.60,0:14:54.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只可惜你不是我喜欢的那一型哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:57.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那笨蛋在说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:58.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就把你解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话应该我说才对
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这把刀到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么像蛇一样弯来弯去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.79,0:15:19.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很忙啦 所以你最好乖乖别反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:23.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不然我会赶不上帮犬夜叉送终啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.67,0:15:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你刚说这话是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.14,0:15:29.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么你来不及帮犬夜叉送终
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:33.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉是你什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不管什么犬夜叉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.45,0:15:37.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我担心的是跟着他的那个可爱女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:39.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道 他们有危险了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:41.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好烦 又是女人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:45.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他们早就完蛋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.53,0:15:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 振作点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.03,0:15:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个时候受的伤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上帮你移开柱子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都晕过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.57,0:16:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大家快醒醒 醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 这个时候我不可以哭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.15,0:16:48.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:53.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉回来之前 我一定要好好保护他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.66,0:16:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 光靠我一个人的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本搬不动他们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.26,0:16:58.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:02.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动动脑筋一定会想出办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:07.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就来救你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你死心吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.55,0:17:17.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那些同伴全都完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:19.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是被我放的火烧死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是毒发身亡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你救不了他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.59,0:17:25.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少废话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.59,0:17:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.29,0:17:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.53,0:17:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,银骨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.37,0:17:43.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这里面还有法宝呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上把你刺穿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别做梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.61,0:18:18.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看刀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.11,0:18:27.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没了那把刀就只有认输啦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.19,0:18:37.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别妄想了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老子今天没有空陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.14,0:18:56.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:07.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寺庙已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.29,0:19:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.16,0:19:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道连杀我的时间都没有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟敢瞧不起我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:29.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少稍微知道奈落是什么样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.21,0:19:31.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片也弄到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.98,0:19:34.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看今天就到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:07.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有人像这小子一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.52,0:20:09.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能一再避开我的蛇骨刀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.79,0:20:13.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个臭小子倒是有点棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天本大爷没那么多闲功夫陪你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.30,0:20:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次再让我看见你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你的死期了 臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 钢牙少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的毫不犹豫掉头就走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.34,0:21:03.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.61,0:21:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬…犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.59,0:21:24.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…我跟自己说 一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.29,0:21:26.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要坚强起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用狐火保护了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让大家不会被火烧伤对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:36.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.37,0:21:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明明已经尽全力了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人全都断气了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:15.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:24.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.12,0:22:34.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.40,0:22:44.07,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:49.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.21,0:22:53.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:23:01.39,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.19,0:23:07.65,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:12.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.44,0:23:19.40,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.98,0:23:29.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.41,0:23:52.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人全都断气了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.28,0:23:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都要怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.51,0:23:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是我早点看穿炼骨的谎言就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在后悔什么 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.28,0:23:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.28,0:24:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说穿了你不过是个半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是保护自己就已经很勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.25,0:24:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当初却让你拥有一把用来守护人的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.19,0:24:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始就太强人所难
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.23,0:24:11.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.46,0:24:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉初次落下男儿泪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一定不是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.30,0:24:16.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你睁开眼睛吧 戈薇
